1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,509
目标明确的活，提示写得越含糊，
When the goal is clear, the vaguer your prompt,

2
00:00:02,529 --> 00:00:04,570
Claude 越费上下文。
the more context Claude burns.

3
00:00:04,590 --> 00:00:06,836
Anthropic 官方入门课专门有一课，
Anthropic's intro course has a whole lesson

4
00:00:06,856 --> 00:00:08,570
讲怎么管这块“记忆”。
on managing this memory.

5
00:00:08,590 --> 00:00:09,404
上下文窗口，
The context window

6
00:00:09,424 --> 00:00:11,640
是 Claude 这次会话的工作记忆。
is Claude's working memory for the session.

7
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:13,275
你的提示、读过的文件、
Your prompts, the files it has read,

8
00:00:13,295 --> 00:00:15,311
命令的输出，全都占位。
command outputs: all of it takes up space.

9
00:00:15,331 --> 00:00:17,068
装满了会自动压缩：
When it fills up, Claude Code compacts automatically:

10
00:00:17,088 --> 00:00:19,020
先清掉旧的工具输出，
it clears old tool output first,

11
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:20,761
不够再总结对话。
then summarizes the conversation.

12
00:00:20,781 --> 00:00:23,862
代价是，早期的详细指令可能丢。
The catch: detailed instructions from early on may be lost.

13
00:00:23,882 --> 00:00:27,104
三个命令：/compact 压成摘要，
Three commands: /compact summarizes and carries on,

14
00:00:27,124 --> 00:00:28,978
/clear 清空对话，
/clear empties the conversation,

15
00:00:28,998 --> 00:00:31,042
/context 看占用。
/context shows what takes the most space.

16
00:00:31,062 --> 00:00:33,429
同一个功能做到快满，用 /compact。
Use /compact when a feature runs you near the limit.

17
00:00:33,449 --> 00:00:35,112
开新功能，用 /clear。
Use /clear when you start a new one.

18
00:00:35,132 --> 00:00:37,185
同一个问题纠正两次还不对，
Corrected the same issue twice and it's still wrong?

19
00:00:37,205 --> 00:00:38,322
就清空重来。
Clear and start over.

20
00:00:38,342 --> 00:00:39,864
小问题想问一句，
For a quick side question, use /btw.

21
00:00:39,884 --> 00:00:42,623
用 /btw，答案不占上下文。
The answer never enters the conversation.

22
00:00:42,643 --> 00:00:44,144
要跨会话记住的事，
For anything to remember across sessions,

23
00:00:44,164 --> 00:00:46,374
写进 CLAUDE.md：压缩之后，
put it in CLAUDE.md. After a compact,

24
00:00:46,394 --> 00:00:48,633
它会从磁盘重新读一遍。
it's re-read from disk.

25
00:00:48,653 --> 00:00:50,893
还有个反直觉的：目标明确的活，
One counterintuitive tip: when the goal is clear,

26
00:00:50,913 --> 00:00:53,183
提示写得越具体，越省上下文。
the more specific the prompt, the less context it uses.

27
00:00:53,203 --> 00:00:55,795
含糊的提示看着短，它却得自己到处翻
A vague prompt looks short, but Claude has to explore

28
00:00:55,815 --> 00:00:58,193
代码、自己推理，反而更费。
and reason on its own, which costs more.

29
00:00:58,213 --> 00:01:00,663
上下文是预算，不是仓库。
Context is a budget, not a warehouse.
